data: {"id": "f71ebf7a6ae94274-thinking-parallel_evidence-1248", "run_id": "f71ebf7a6ae94274", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 证据结论（aiops-case-v13/workload）\n\n### 已确认事实\n1. **Pod 当前状态矛盾**：`kubectl get pod` 返回 **Terminating**（describe 中 `status: Terminating (lasts <invalid>)`），但 `phase: Running`（YAML 中 `containerStatuses.app.ready=True, phase=Running`）。这是一个**状态不一致**现象——Pod 仍在运行但被 kubelet 标记为 Terminating。\n2. **deletionTimestamp = 2026-09-14T07:57:34Z**，`deletionGracePeriodSeconds = 3900s`（65分钟）。bash 计算显示 deletionTimestamp 是**未来时间**（now 约 06:53，deletion 为 07:57），这意味着 deletionTimestamp 是 Pod spec 中预设的**模拟值**，非真实删除触发时间。\n3. ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789368804927, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

